      "source": [
        "# Closure variable\n",
        "\n",
        "A closure variable is a free variable referenced by a nested function and captured from an enclosing function's scope. Its value remains accessible after the outer function returns.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-closure-variable)"
      ]
    }
  ],
